(2) Has at least 100 residential sites, platted and recorded in the office of the clerk of the superior court of either Haralson County or Carroll County, depending on the actual physical location of the golf club;
(3) Has a social club with:
a. An 18-hole golf course of regulation size;
b. A restaurant or eatery used exclusively for the purpose of preparing and serving meals, with a seating capacity of at least 50 patrons;
